1
00:00:00,495 --> 00:00:02,770
Meet WeKnora, v0.9.0.

2
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,430
Your assistant is right beside the logo.

3
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:08,570
Ask what's new, or how something works.

4
00:00:08,570 --> 00:00:11,380
It checks the product docs before answering.

5
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:16,645
Get a practical overview of the release, and help with the page you're on.

6
00:00:16,645 --> 00:00:19,905
The Assistant works with your identity and permissions.

7
00:00:22,595 --> 00:00:25,855
Need an agent? Start here, and describe the job.

8
00:00:28,195 --> 00:00:33,430
It finds the knowledge, models, MCP tools, and skills already available.

9
00:00:34,395 --> 00:00:38,355
Review how they fit together, then approve the agent's creation.

10
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:44,805
Now your coordinator is ready, with the right knowledge and tools connected.

11
00:00:47,570 --> 00:00:50,905
For a bigger task, let several agents share the work.

12
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:55,983
Atlas checks the agenda. Iris reviews sign-ups.

13
00:00:55,983 --> 00:00:58,055
Nova handles preparation.

14
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:04,280
Their results return to one conversation, as a briefing you can actually use.

15
00:01:05,570 --> 00:01:09,205
For recurring work, describe the task and when it should run.

16
00:01:11,045 --> 00:01:14,207
The Assistant adds your time zone and access rules.

17
00:01:14,207 --> 00:01:16,505
Check the schedule before saving.

18
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:23,430
Try a run now. Get the preparation brief, then let the schedule handle the next one.

19
00:01:27,595 --> 00:01:30,355
Choose read only, ask first, or auto.

20
00:01:32,220 --> 00:01:36,280
For a change, check the exact resource and proposed update.

21
00:01:37,170 --> 00:01:40,380
Approve it. The name updates in your knowledge base.

22
00:01:41,620 --> 00:01:47,080
Longer tasks can keep running in the background, with progress right in the conversation.

23
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:51,930
When it's ready, open the finished run sheet.

24
00:01:53,570 --> 00:01:57,205
Browser Skill takes the work into your connected browser.

25
00:01:58,945 --> 00:02:01,157
Fill the event form from your knowledge.

26
00:02:01,157 --> 00:02:04,805
Watch it happen, then review the draft before publishing.

27
00:02:07,595 --> 00:02:10,880
Looking for an image? Search your documents visually.

28
00:02:12,045 --> 00:02:15,980
See its description, extracted text, and the source document.

29
00:02:17,595 --> 00:02:20,705
Wiki Graph groups connected ideas by topic.

30
00:02:21,995 --> 00:02:24,930
Focus on a group to explore the connections.

31
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:29,155
Then open a page and read it in context.

32
00:02:30,570 --> 00:02:34,355
And every sourced answer gives you a way to check the evidence.

33
00:02:35,795 --> 00:02:39,905
Preview the citation, then jump straight to the supporting passage.

34
00:02:41,495 --> 00:02:44,430
WeKnora. Ask. Create. Work together.
